 2.0.<\/li><li>Longitud: 1 Metro<\/li><li>Color: Blanco<\/li><li>Normativas: RoHS<\/li><li>Test de funcionamiento: 100% testado<\/li><li><b>Contenido del paquete:<\/b><\/li><li>1 x Cable USB 2.0 3A, tipo USB-C\/M-USB-C\/M, Blanco, 1&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"NANO CABLE","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.04,"unit_price":6.82,"unit_price_tax":6.82,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cables","sub_category":"Cable USB","quantity":5,"brand":"NANO CABLE","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_nan-cab%2010%2001%202301-w_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":1.82}}},"8433281014411":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8433281014411",false],"wholesale_price":[4.87,false],"price":[9.87,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.05",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:199629","Cat. IDs: 68","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 68","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/5a839d76db5e30981fcfa1c3cfea04d9.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"Cable USB 4.0 Nanocable 10.01.5001\/ USB Tipo-C Macho - USB Tipo-C Macho\/ Hasta 240W\/ 40Gbps\/ 1m\/ Negro","category":"Cables","sub_category":"Cable USB","unit_price":9.870000000000001,"reference":"10.01.5001","ean13":"8433281014411","weight":"0.05","quantity":5,"brand":"NANO CABLE","description_pt":"<h2>Cable USB 4 Gen 3x2 40Gbps 5A\/240W, USB-C\/M-USB-C\/M, Negro, 1 m<\/h2><div><br><\/div><div><h2>Especificaci\u00f3n:<\/h2><p><ul><li>Ideal para conectar su nuevo dispositivo m\u00f3vil\/tablet\/dispositivo de almacenamiento externo USB-C a un ordenador con USB-C.<\/li><li>El USB 4 es el doble de r\u00e1pido que su antecesor, el USB 3.2, y alcanza una velocidad de transferencia de hasta 40 Gbps siempre que los dispositivos conectados soporten esa velocidad.<\/li><li>Dispone de carga r\u00e1pida PD (Power Delivery), el voltaje m\u00ednimo para Power Delivery es de 7.5V pero puede alcanzar hasta 240W seg\u00fan el dispositivo, a un voltaje m\u00e1ximo de 20V.<\/li><li>Compatible con v\u00eddeo de hasta 8K a 60Hz.<\/li><li>Compatible con Thunderbolt 3 y Thunderbolt 4.<\/li><li>Admite protocolos HDR10, HDCP 1.4 y 2.3, PCI Express, DisplayPort<\/li><li>Longitud del cable: 1 metro<\/li><li>Color: Negro<\/li><li>Normativas: RoHS<\/li><li>Test de Funcionamiento: 100% testado<\/li><li><b>Contenido del paquete:<\/b><\/li><li>1 x Cable USB 4 Gen 3x2 40Gbps 5A\/240W, tipo USB-C\/M-USB-C\/M, Negro, 1 m<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/div>","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_nan-cab%2010%2001%205001_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"4.87","unit_price_tax":9.870000000000001},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["8433281014411"],"reference":"10.01.5001","name":{"1":"Cable USB 4.0 Nanocable 10.01.5001\/ USB Tipo-C Macho - USB Tipo-C Macho\/ Hasta 240W\/ 40Gbps\/ 1m\/ Negro","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<h2>Cable USB 4 Gen 3x2 40Gbps 5A\/240W, USB-C\/M-USB-C\/M, Negro, 1 m<\/h2><div><br><\/div><div><h2>Especificaci\u00f3n:<\/h2><p><ul><li>Ideal para conectar su nuevo dispositivo m\u00f3vil\/tablet\/dispositivo de almacenamiento externo USB-C a un ordenador con USB-C.<\/li><li>El USB 4 es el doble de r\u00e1pido que su antecesor, el USB 3.2, y alcanza una velocidad de transferencia de hasta 40 Gbps siempre que los dispositivos conectados soporten esa velocidad.<\/li><li>Dispone de carga r\u00e1pida PD (Power Delivery), el voltaje m\u00ednimo para Power Delivery es de 7.5V pero puede alcanzar hasta 240W seg\u00fan el dispositivo, a un voltaje m\u00e1ximo de 20V.<\/li><li>Compatible con v\u00eddeo de hasta 8K a 60Hz.<\/li><li>Compatible con Thunderbolt 3 y Thunderbolt 4.<\/li><li>Admite protocolos HDR10, HDCP 1.4 y 2.3, PCI Express, DisplayPort<\/li><li>Longitud del cable: 1 metro<\/li><li>Color: Negro<\/li><li>Normativas: RoHS<\/li><li>Test de Funcionamiento: 100% testado<\/li><li><b>Contenido del paquete:<\/b><\/li><li>1 x Cable USB 4 Gen 3x2 40Gbps 5A\/240W, tipo USB-C\/M-USB-C\/M, Negro, 1 m<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"NANO CABLE","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.05,"unit_price":9.87,"unit_price_tax":9.87,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cables","sub_category":"Cable USB","quantity":5,"brand":"NANO CABLE","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_nan-cab%2010%2001%205001_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":4.87}}},"8433281014428":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8433281014428",false],"wholesale_price":[6.81,false],"price":[11.81,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.08",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:199630","Cat. IDs: 68","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 68","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/c05e9580018a552db2e3