ca. Es perfecto para manos de tama\u00f1o mediano a grande.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Conectividad mediante cable por puerto de conexi\u00f3n USB&nbsp;<\/li><li>Compatible con dispositivos Windows\u00ae 8\/10\/11, Android&#8482;, iOS\/iPadOS 13 y MacOs.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Cuenta con un total de 6 botones, dos de ellos laterales alineados con el pulgar con los que ser\u00e1 m\u00e1s f\u00e1cil avanzar o retroceder con agilidad.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Pulsaci\u00f3n de botones Silencioso: tecnolog\u00eda Silent Click.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Rueda de desplazamiento de silicona antideslizante con detalles cromados&nbsp;<\/li><li>Hasta 1600 dpi seleccionables para una m\u00e1xima precisi\u00f3n.<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><h2>Especificaciones y Detalles<\/h2><p><ul><li>Dimensiones 5,8 \u00d7 2 \u00d7 11,2 cm<\/li><li>Apagado autom\u00e1tico<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Bluetooth<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Carga por USB<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Clic silencioso<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Compatible multidispositivo<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Plug and Play<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/p><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"SUBBLIM","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.13,"unit_price":13.59,"unit_price_tax":13.59,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Ratones","sub_category":"Ratones","quantity":5,"brand":"SUBBLIM","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_sub-mou%20g%20vert%20ergo%20wired%20bk_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":8.59}}},"8436586743048":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8436586743048",false],"wholesale_price":[8.59,false],"price":[13.59,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weig